{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月28日 15:14 星期六</p>\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">最後更新   2026年11月28日 16:42 星期六</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>今日（28日）下午2時05分左右，警方接獲多宗報案，指屯門建發里2號華運工業大廈外牆棚網起火。消防到場出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊，約2時40分將火救熄。事件中無人受傷，約200人自行疏散到安全位置。據現場消息，大廈多層用作洗衣用途，起火原因有待消防調查。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>網上圖片見到，大片棚網被燒毀，竹棚目測大致完整。有屋宇署人員在場觀察及調查事件。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕火警 棚網 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:56:17.959656+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":235,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:14:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T09:50:31.203214+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T08:49:56.213672+00:00","content_hash":"e97a2a0eb82c8a4dda8913bcd3a93d0e002464adccbd29181ed31abb3a47f9e0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}